/-!
# Positive width-slack decomposition of the upper baseline determinant

The three integer Horner expressions are eight times the rational certificate
entries. They multiply the actual first and second even widths. The original
identity is proved separately; no solver or JSON is a formal dependency.
-/
namespace SPR.N6.UpperResidualCertificate
